cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these measurements, please cite this repository."
title: "Local LLM speed on an integrated GPU - 23 models, one mini PC"
abstract: "Generation speed in tokens per second for 23 local large language models, measured one model at a time on a single AMD mini PC with an integrated Radeon 890M and no discrete graphics card, September 2026. Contains the machine-readable CSV, the measurement script, and a written list of the known gaps in the method."
